# The territory border: placing the castle shows its border posts at once, a pole on each edge between the territory
# and the land nobody owns, a water post where the edge lies in water, drawn under the trees, buildings, and settlers.
# The castle's click places it at 15,5; its territory reaches 8 steps, so the border runs about 23,5 to the east.
# Run it on the game view with seed 4455544685788642 and size 1, with the install:
#   sh tools/play-run.sh border-posts --game-view --seed 4455544685788642 --size 1 --fps 10
# On the basic content set, without the install:
#   sh tools/play-run.sh border-posts --game-view --seed 4455544685788642 --size 1 --content-set basic --fps 10
expect seed = 4455544685788642
expect size = 1
wait 0.3
shot before 15 5 9
click-tile 15 5
wait 0.3
shot territory 15 5 9
shot east 23 5 2 3
shot west 7 5 2 3
